    {
      "source": "Callback interface for the customization of the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/site/docs/7.0.x/api/org/springframework/security/oauth2/jwt/NimbusJwtDecoder.JwkSetUriJwtDecoderBuilder.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.security.oauth2.jwt\"><code>NimbusJwtDecoder.JwkSetUriJwtDecoderBuilder</code></a> used\nto create the auto-configured <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/site/docs/7.0.x/api/org/springframework/security/oauth2/jwt/JwtDecoder.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.security.oauth2.jwt\"><code>JwtDecoder</code></a> for a JWK set URI that has been\nconfigured directly or obtained through an issuer URI.",
      "translation": "用于自定义 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/site/docs/7.0.x/api/org/springframework/security/oauth2/jwt/NimbusJwtDecoder.JwkSetUriJwtDecoderBuilder.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.security.oauth2.jwt\"><code>NimbusJwtDecoder.JwkSetUriJwtDecoderBuilder</code></a> 的回调接口，该构建器用于创建自动配置的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/site/docs/7.0.x/api/org/springframework/security/oauth2/jwt/JwtDecoder.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.security.oauth2.jwt\"><code>JwtDecoder</code></a>，该解码器针对直接配置的 JWK 集 URI 或通过发行者 URI 获取的 JWK 集 URI。",
